shell32: This PC in tiles with the drives' capacity, as in Windows 10

The folder view gets FVM_TILE (on comctl32's LV_VIEW_TILE) and draws the
tiles: the large icon, the name, for a drive a capacity bar (red past nine
tenths) and "X free of Y"; Windows 10's light blue when hot or selected.
This PC opens in tiles.
